[{"id":162210814,"discussion_id":"16ae8ac18eeedcf727d93304817111a9250d66bf","body":"Thanks for your pull-request.\nThe full list of commands accepted by me can be found at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/robot/robot%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md#-%E5%A6%82%E9%9C%80%E4%BA%86%E8%A7%A3%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%E4%B8%8B%E6%96%B9%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC)。\nYou can get sig-info at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/community/blob/master/CANN/sigs/ops-nn/sig-info.yaml)\n\n\n---\n\n## PR Approval Progress\n\n✅ **Congratulations! All modules have met the lgtm and approve requirements.**\n\n### Module Approval Details\n\n| module | lgtm status | approve status |\n|------|-----------|--------------|\n| \\*/\\*/op_host/\\*_def.cpp | ✅ [*wangyongguang*](https://gitcode.com/wangyongguang), [*zhou-qilong*](https://gitcode.com/zhou-qilong) (2/2) | ✅ [*wangyongguang*](https://gitcode.com/wangyongguang) (1/1) |\n| activation | ✅ [*wangyongguang*](https://gitcode.com/wangyongguang), [*tangweiwei2*](https://gitcode.com/tangweiwei2), [*zhou-qilong*](https://gitcode.com/zhou-qilong) (3/2) | ✅ [*tangweiwei2*](https://gitcode.com/tangweiwei2), [*zhou-qilong*](https://gitcode.com/zhou-qilong), [*wangyongguang*](https://gitcode.com/wangyongguang) (3/1) |\n\n> \uD83D\uDCA1 Tip:\n> - **Committer** can comment `/approve` or `/lgtm`\n> - Commenting `/approve` implies both code review (lgtm) and intent to merge (approve)\n","created_at":"2026-02-04T15:55:52+08:00","updated_at":"2026-02-07T10:24:11+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":162210835,"discussion_id":"1ab32e77d7f08a9b75b001acc4deb32de99bd1a6","body":":large_blue_circle: source code change are detected, tasks labels is removed in this pull request!","created_at":"2026-02-04T15:55:56+08:00","updated_at":"2026-02-04T15:55:56+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":162210842,"discussion_id":"d7d5b9356c4c0394dc1317872011d383c057eff1","body":"compile","created_at":"2026-02-04T15:55:57+08:00","updated_at":"2026-02-04T15:55:57+08:00","user":{"id":"6822d31324adff5452d7be49","login":"ligen75","object_id":"6822d31324adff5452d7be49","name":"ligen75","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/ligen75"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":162210885,"discussion_id":"ef4faf27d1db4555cefbe08402dc4ed18dac1e9c","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n为ReluV2算子新增对int64数据类型的支持。当前算子实现中，其tiling逻辑和算子定义均缺少对int64输入/输出类型的处理分支和注册，导致在使用int64类型时会失败。本次修改旨在扩展算子的数据类型支持范围。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n本次修改的核心是在算子实现的各关键环节添加对int64类型的支持。具体包括：在tiling实现中新增int64类型的处理分支，使用特定的tiling key和计算DAG；在算子定义文件中将int64类型添加到支持的输入/输出数据类型列表；在算子二进制配置文件中新增int64数据类型的配置项。同时，在算子内核DAG头文件中新增了用于int64类型计算的`ReluMaxDAG`模板结构，使用`Vec::Maxs`操作实现ReLU功能。","created_at":"2026-02-04T15:56:06+08:00","updated_at":"2026-02-04T15:56:06+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":162210921,"discussion_id":"de525d1abe6edd44be90d519f309a609db11bc52","body":"### 代码结构与可维护性: 新增的 INT64 数据类型分支使用了不同的模板类 `ReluV2MaxDAG<int64_t>::OpDag`，而其他数据类型分支均使用 `ReluV2DAG<T1, T2>::OpDag` 模板。这种不一致性可能导致维护困难，且 `ReluV2MaxDAG` 的模板参数数量（一个）与 `ReluV2DAG`（两个）不同，暗示了底层实现可能存在差异，但代码中未提供任何注释说明这种差异的合理性。\n\n**问题类型**: 代码结构与可维护性\n**文件路径**: `activation/relu_v2/op_host/arch35/relu_v2_tiling_arch35.cpp`\n**行号**: 173\n**问题代码**:\n```cpp\n        res = elewiseBaseTiling.DoTiling<ReluV2MaxDAG<int64_t>::OpDag>(tiling->baseTiling);\n```\n**修改建议**:\n```\n1. 添加注释说明为何 INT64 类型需要使用 `ReluV2MaxDAG` 而非 `ReluV2DAG`。\n2. 如果 `ReluV2MaxDAG` 是 `ReluV2DAG` 的别名或特化，应使用一致的命名以提升可读性。\n3. 考虑将数据类型与对应模板的映射关系提取为常量或查找表，以减少 `if-else` 链的复杂度并便于未来扩展。\n```\n\n---\n*此评论由代码审查工具自动生成*","created_at":"2026-02-04T15:56:17+08:00","updated_at":"2026-02-04T15:56:17+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"diff_comment","resolved":false,"diff_position":{"start_new_line":173,"end_new_line":173,"start_old_line":173,"end_old_line":173,"position_type":"text"}},{"id":162210928,"discussion_id":"bdd7af3ab3553370bb8b20cd8c6d9adde856af82","body":"### 代码结构与可维护性: 第56行在定义OpCopyOut1时，使用了'uint1_t'作为Placeholder::Out1的模板参数。'uint1_t'不是C/C++标准类型，通常应为'uint8_t'。结合第39-40行ReluV2DAG中的相同逻辑，那里使用的是'uint8_t'类型。使用非标准类型可能导致编译错误或平台兼容性问题。\n\n**问题类型**: 代码结构与可维护性\n**文件路径**: `activation/relu_v2/op_kernel/arch35/relu_v2_dag.h`\n**行号**: 56\n**问题代码**:\n```unknown\nusing OpCopyOut1 = Bind<Vec::CopyOut<uint8_t>, Placeholder::Out1<uint1_t>, OpResult1>;\n```\n**修改建议**:\n```\n将第56行的'uint1_t'修改为'uint8_t'，以保持类型一致性并确保代码可移植性。修改后应为：using OpCopyOut1 = Bind<Vec::CopyOut<uint8_t>, Placeholder::Out1<uint8_t>, OpResult1>;\n```\n\n---\n*此评论由代码审查工具自动生成*","created_at":"2026-02-04T15:56:19+08:00","updated_at":"2026-02-04T15:56:19+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"diff_comment","resolved":false,"diff_position":{"start_new_line":56,"end_new_line":56,"start_old_line":56,"end_old_line":56,"position_type":"text"}},{"id":162210977,"discussion_id":"0bcfbf2f45a04d091a891858ccc0fe58a6ff0e01","body":"流水线任务触发成功 [<b><a href='https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/ci/ci_guide.md'>流水线指导</a></b>]\n任务链接 [<b><a href='https://www.openlibing.com/apps/pipelineDetail?pipelineId=b582e6c0e2c54a3f8168601c5b292c24&pipelineRunId=fdcb207cf42f41fd9e7d52c7689234d0&projectName=CANN'>fdcb207cf42f41fd9e7d52c7689234d0</a></b>]\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse\"><tr><th>任务名称</th><th>状态</th><th>日志</th><th>下载链接</th></tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td><strong>codecheck</strong></td>\n                            <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                            <td><a href=https://www.openlibing.com/apps/entryCheckDashCode/MR_5cf6cce0889f411b8fb0ba32feb18a73/8776d619b698932d7b0312fdd8995975?projectId=300033&codeHostingPlatformFlag=gitcode>>>>>></a></td>\n                            <td><a href=></a></td>\n                        </tr> \n                        <tr>\n                            <td><strong>anti_virus</strong></td>\n                            <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                            <td><a href=https://www.openlibing.com/apps/entryCheckNew/poisoningresult/95d56207-1cde-487e-befb-d6e1762ddf69/CANN/ops-nn?projectName=CANN&codeHostingPlatformFlag=gitcode>>>>>></a></td>\n                            <td><a href=></a></td>\n                        </tr> \n                        <tr>\n                            <td><strong>Check_Pr</strong></td>\n                            <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                            <td><a href=https://www.openlibing.com/apps/pipelineDetail?pipelineId=b582e6c0e2c54a3f8168601c5b292c24&pipelineRunId=fdcb207cf42f41fd9e7d52c7689234d0&projectName=CANN>>>>>><